Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.23,0:00:05.23,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,The changing room is \Nway too far from the venue...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.89,0:00:10.57,Italics,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Maybe it's careless to attend a cosplay \Nevent in the same town where I work.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.32,0:00:14.24,Italics,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Well, considering all the foot traffic,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.24,0:00:17.37,Italics,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,and that it's in the opposite direction from \Nthe office, and it's a day off...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.49,0:00:17.74,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnArial\c&H8F6C6D&\b1\3c&HFCFFFC&\shad0\}Cosplay Event Reception\NOn the Left
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.63,0:00:20.64,Italics,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,I doubt I'll run into anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.64,0:00:22.65,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Huh? Hayakawa-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.25,0:00:26.15,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,What a coincidence, \Nrunning into you on a day off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.77,0:00:27.75,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.29,0:00:39.34,Italics,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,My name is Hayakawa Chinatsu, 22 years old...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.93,0:00:42.52,Italics,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,I'm an office worker in my \Nfirst year of employment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.18,0:00:48.30,Italics,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,And my boss just found out \Nabout me being an otaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.45,0:00:56.13,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,Oh, I love you so much, I just have to laugh
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.99,0:01:05.75,Show_Title,Title sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H292A2F&\bord0}My {\1a&HFF&\bord1\3c&HA183CA&}T{\3c&H000000&}iny {\bord0\1a&H00&}Senpai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.50,0:01:08.83,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,We've got an emergency here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.25,0:01:11.61,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,Are you paying attention, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.00,0:01:17.84,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,There's someone other than me \Ndancing around inside of my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.84,0:01:20.09,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,I want to talk to her
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.60,0:01:23.14,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,I want to touch her
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.14,0:01:28.63,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,Look, I get it, but for now try to pipe down
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.15,0:01:31.86,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,What in the world am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.86,0:01:34.61,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,You're right next to me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.61,0:01:40.86,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,And this is the perfect chance...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.62,0:01:42.44,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,HONEY
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.44,0:01:47.15,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,I'm trapped by that sweet rich taste
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.15,0:01:50.36,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,And I don't think I can ever escape
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.36,0:01:52.86,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,I may as well just sink into it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.86,0:01:53.67,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,HONEY
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.67,0:01:58.47,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,It's another day in your dazzling presence
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.68,0:02:01.47,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,We may never be \Non the same page with this love but
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.47,0:02:07.90,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,Oh, I love you so much, I just have to laugh
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.49,0:02:23.49,Episode_Title,Eptitle sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(40,310)\an1}#04 {\fscx80}When {\c&H7E64CE&}It {\c}Comes to Him, I'm Not Sure Yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.35,0:02:23.49,Main - Top,Akina,0,0,0,,What are you up to, Hayakawa-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.25,0:02:31.71,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Y-You've got the wrong person! \NI-I'm not Hayakawa, Manager!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.71,0:02:33.50,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,You just called me your manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.50,0:02:35.88,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnArial\c&H8F6C6D&\b1\3c&HFCFFFC&\shad0\}Cosplay Event Reception\NOn the Left
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.79,0:02:35.88,Italics,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Of all the people...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.48,0:02:42.14,Italics,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,The manager is like the textbook \Ndefinition of a normie, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.72,0:02:48.77,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Huh. A cosplay event? I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.52,0:02:50.54,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Hayakawa-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.54,0:02:51.77,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Y-Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.77,0:02:54.55,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Where do you buy an outfit like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.55,0:02:58.63,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,W-Well, I-I actually made it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.78,0:03:01.28,Italics,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.28,0:03:03.10,Italics,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,It's all over for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.10,0:03:05.26,Italics,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,He's probably wondering \Nwhy a grown woman is doing
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.26,0:03:07.29,Italics,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,something like this and thinks it's creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.85,0:03:10.79,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,I have to say, Hayakawa-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.79,0:03:13.15,Italics,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Here it comes! The words every otaku dreads!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.15,0:03:16.30,Italics,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,I don't wanna hear it! I don't wanna \Nhear my manager call me creepy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.72,0:03:19.92,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,That's pretty cool, Hayakawa-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.68,0:03:24.46,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,It is?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.46,0:03:26.93,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Yeah. I think it's really cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.94,0:03:35.69,Main,Hayakwa,0,0,0,,Wait, how?! What about this is cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.69,0:03:36.88,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Your approach to life, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.88,0:03:38.32,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,A-All that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.32,0:03:40.30,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,I don't have any hobbies,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.30,0:03:45.48,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,so I respect people who do, \Nlike you. I think it's pretty cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.66,0:03:52.73,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Then again, that outfit \Nis more cute than cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.82,0:03:58.21,Italics,Hayakwawa,0,0,0,,How can he just up and say \Nsomething like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.41,0:04:00.27,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.27,0:04:02.97,Main,Haykawa,0,0,0,,N-Nothing, th-thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.01,0:04:07.64,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Manager! Please don't tell anyone about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.39,0:04:10.19,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Is it supposed to be a secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.19,0:04:11.52,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.52,0:04:13.77,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,But it's really impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.77,0:04:16.42,Main,Hayakwa,0,0,0,,That's a matter of opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.42,0:04:17.77,Main,Hayakwa,0,0,0,,A-Anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.77,0:04:23.28,Main,Hayakwa,0,0,0,,Let's keep this a secret, \Njust between us. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.96,0:04:27.04,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.04,0:04:29.32,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Why would you say it again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.32,0:04:30.54,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.94,0:04:35.01,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,The first one was more about \Nyour costume and how you look,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.01,0:04:38.42,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,and the second one was more about \Nyou personally, Hayakawa-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.94,0:04:43.12,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,I didn't want an actual explanation!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.12,0:04:45.93,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,I didn't hear anything \Nyou just said! Not a thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.93,0:04:48.17,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,But it's true that you're—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.17,0:04:49.53,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Like! I! Said!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.53,0:04:53.62,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,I heard nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.69,0:04:58.69,Sign_Basic,Word Balloon sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H8C8F8D&\fnArial\shad0\3c&HFCFFFC&\fs16\pos(408,52.666)\frz283.1}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.24,0:05:05.49,Italics,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,The deadline for Comiket \Nsubmissions is coming up...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.72,0:05:07.99,Italics,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,But I can't focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.47,0:05:12.55,Italics,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,I can't believe my boss \Nfound out that I'm a cosplayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.55,0:05:16.89,Italics,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,I asked him to keep quiet, \Nand I doubt he'd blab, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.77,0:05:20.67,Italics,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,I wonder if there's a pressure point \Nto erase someone's memory...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.67,0:05:23.01,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Where am I? What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.24,0:05:26.57,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,How did this even happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.57,0:05:30.76,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Work is going to be a nightmare tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.64,0:05:33.39,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.99,0:05:37.64,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I'd like you to review the materials I put \Ntogether for the upcoming project submission.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.64,0:05:39.90,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Sure! I'll take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.90,0:05:41.39,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Let's see here...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.39,0:05:45.10,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Yep, you covered \Nyour bases nicely! Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.10,0:05:46.97,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.97,0:05:49.52,Italics,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Didn't get anywhere with my manuscript...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.52,0:05:50.92,Italics,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Didn't sleep much...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.92,0:05:52.61,Italics,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,This really sucks...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.61,0:05:55.91,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Hayakawa. Hey, Hayakawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.66,0:05:59.64,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,You okay? You look worn out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.64,0:06:02.29,Main,Haykawa,0,0,0,,Oh, er, I-I'm totally fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.88,0:06:06.97,Main,Haykawa,0,0,0,,It's just, a bunch of stuff happened \Nyesterday... and I didn't get much sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.32,0:06:10.00,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,A lack of sleep can contribute \Nto all kinds of health problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.00,0:06:11.64,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Be careful, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.12,0:06:15.88,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,When you can't sleep, try counting cats!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.88,0:06:17.50,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,One kitty,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.50,0:06:19.10,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,two kitties,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.10,0:06:20.76,Main - Top,Shiori,0,0,0,,three kitties,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.07,0:06:22.76,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I think most people use sheep...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.76,0:06:22.58,Main - Top,Shiori,0,0,0,,four kitties—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.38,0:06:25.61,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,No! Cats are fine, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.76,0:06:29.19,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Thanks for the concern, Katase-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.60,0:06:30.79,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Hayakawa-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.69,0:06:33.91,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Are you not feeling well? Everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.19,0:06:35.54,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,M-Manager?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.82,0:06:40.79,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Uh, well... er... yes, I-I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.05,0:06:45.80,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Okay. In that case, would you like to \Njoin me for dinner tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.60,0:06:48.52,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,I was hoping we could talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.35,0:06:51.16,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,In a nice, quiet restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.96,0:06:53.30,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Just the two of us,\Nif that's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.30,0:06:57.56,Italics,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Dinner for j-just the two of us?! \NYou mean like...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.56,0:07:01.48,Italics,Akina,0,0,0,,Cute... Cute... Cute...{repeat as necessary}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.56,0:07:04.35,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,W-Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.82,0:07:07.23,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,a-as long as we're done before the last train.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.23,0:07:08.42,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Sounds great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.88,0:07:11.21,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Let me know when\Nyou're done work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.68,0:07:13.54,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.29,0:07:15.40,Main,Shioiri,0,0,0,,Is this a date?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.40,0:07:16.74,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,I-It isn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.74,0:07:18.00,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Sounds suspicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.00,0:07:19.87,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Well, it's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.44,0:07:22.32,Italics,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.91,0:07:25.59,Italics,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,This isn't a date or anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.92,0:07:33.22,Italics,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,My boss just... asked me out... \Nfor a bit of dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.71,0:07:35.93,Italics,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.66,0:07:38.22,Italics,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,It's not a big deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.95,0:07:42.46,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Sorry about the wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.65,0:07:50.57,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.57,0:07:52.98,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,W-Well... er...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.90,0:07:55.63,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Thanks for the save.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.63,0:07:58.72,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Don't mention it. Watch your step, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.72,0:07:59.37,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.68,0:08:04.50,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Speaking of... when you came for your \Nemployment test, didn't you break a heel?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.54,0:08:08.13,Main,Hayakwa,0,0,0,,You remember that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.13,0:08:10.26,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.04,0:08:16.26,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,That must've been rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.67,0:08:21.77,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,But I'm glad you passed, \Nand now we get to work together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.77,0:08:23.62,Italics,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,He remembered...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.88,0:08:27.02,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Now, let's get a move on, Hayakawa-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.02,0:08:28.27,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.20,0:08:34.64,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,I'd think you're used to the office by now,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.64,0:08:37.24,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,but do you have any issues \Nor things you're worried about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.24,0:08:41.26,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,No. Everyone is really nice, \Nso nothing comes to mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.26,0:08:43.32,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Well, that's good to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.32,0:08:45.34,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,The section chief mentioned \Nhow impressed he was
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.34,0:08:46.93,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,with how much faster you've gotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.93,0:08:49.13,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Come on, it's nothing that impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.64,0:08:54.22,Italics,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,All he's brought up \Nduring dinner is work stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.22,0:08:57.14,Italics,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,so I guess this is more like \Na dinner meeting than anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.10,0:09:02.25,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Manager, didn't you mention \Nsomething you wanted to discuss?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.09,0:09:04.14,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.51,0:09:07.15,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Hayakawa-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.67,0:09:11.39,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,I know this might surprise you \Ncoming out of the blue, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.92,0:09:17.41,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Hayakawa-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.08,0:09:22.44,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,when I look at you, I got really excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.90,0:09:27.50,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,I've never felt this way before,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.19,0:09:31.42,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,and I'm not sure if it's fair \Nto spring this on you...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.21,0:09:37.32,Italics,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Hang on... is this... is he...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.43,0:09:40.43,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Hayakawa-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.72,0:09:42.51,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Y-Yes?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.91,0:09:47.02,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,I'd like to attend a cosplay event with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.90,0:09:52.59,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,I mean, when I think about \Nhow you made that costume,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.59,0:09:55.50,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,I get excited thinking about \Nhow much fun it must be!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.50,0:09:57.03,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,That's what you meant?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.03,0:10:00.84,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Well... are you saying you \Nwant to cosplay, too, Manager?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.84,0:10:03.77,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Nope. When I went home \Nand started looking into it,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.77,0:10:07.50,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,I found out about photo sessions \Nthey have for cosplay, and well...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.42,0:10:10.44,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,I'd love to capture your exploits with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.44,0:10:13.05,Italics,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,What a scary combo of initiative \Nand purchasing power!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.44,0:10:17.24,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,I-I mean, you could just take pictures \Nof whatever cosplay you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.64,0:10:19.47,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,You don't need me for that...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.47,0:10:23.62,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,But you were the one who made me \Nrealize it'd be fun, Hayakawa-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.43,0:10:27.08,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,I want it to be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.16,0:10:34.07,Italics,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,It's not fair how he can just say stuff \Nlike that with a straight face...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.15,0:10:37.46,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,The month after next,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.12,0:10:43.64,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,there's going to be an event \Nat the same location, so if you want...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.57,0:10:49.44,Main - Top,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Oh, but in exchange, you need the check out \Nthe things my costumes are from!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.87,0:10:51.83,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(225,0)\pos(374,344)\fnComic Sans MS\b1\fsp2\c&H000000&\bord0\shad0}Real otaku always proselytize
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.44,0:10:51.83,Main - Top,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Otherwise you can't take pictures!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.64,0:10:54.68,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.68,0:10:55.98,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,How?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.98,0:10:57.84,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,None of that was cute at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.84,0:11:01.40,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Yes, it was. The way you're so earnest \Nabout talking about the things you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.40,0:11:02.56,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,It was very c—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.56,0:11:04.51,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,No more explanations!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.51,0:11:05.72,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,But you're the one who was—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.72,0:11:09.15,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,I do not want to hear it at all! \NNot another word!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.36,0:11:15.87,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Shinozaki, you wanna grab lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.87,0:11:18.89,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Sure. Let me just finish this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.89,0:11:19.83,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.32,0:11:22.24,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,You need to talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.78,0:11:26.24,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Well... yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.27,0:11:30.36,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Okay, one sec. I'll be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.98,0:11:32.62,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,I'll wait in the lobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.62,0:11:37.55,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Y'know, Hayakawa-san and Shinozaki-kun \Nseem closer than regular coworkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.55,0:11:40.75,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Apparently, they're childhood friends \Nwho grew up as neighbors.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.75,0:11:43.11,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Oh, right. I remember \Nhearing about that, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.89,0:11:47.08,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Are you interested in what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.08,0:11:49.21,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Katase-san, there's no need to get giddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.21,0:11:52.64,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Since you always pick on me, \NI'm just glad for a chance at payback!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.05,0:11:58.55,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Hayakawa-san might've denied it before, \Nbut maybe there is actually a chance...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.40,0:12:03.28,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\p1\pos(535,119)\an5\bord0\shad0}m 0 0 l 118 0 l 118 168 l 0 168
Dialogue: 1,0:11:59.40,0:12:03.28,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(536.5,119)\fnComic Sans MS\an5\b1\fs24\c&H000000&\bord0\shad0}Or the\Nreunited\Nchildhood\Nfriends/\Nclassmates\Nromance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.60,0:12:03.28,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,A reunited childhood \Nfriends/classmates romance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.28,0:12:06.66,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\p1\pos(104,109)\an5\bord0\shad0}m 0 0 l 118 0 l 118 166 l 0 166
Dialogue: 1,0:12:03.28,0:12:06.66,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(105,109)\fnComic Sans MS\an5\b1\fs24\c&H000000&\bord0\shad0}The age-gap\Nromance\Nbetween\Na senpai\Nand kohai\Nat work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.20,0:12:06.66,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,An age-gap romance \Nbetween a senpai and kohai at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.66,0:12:10.10,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Which one am I supposed to root for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.10,0:12:13.29,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Sh-Sh-Shinozaki-san and I aren't like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.29,0:12:14.92,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,More importantly, Manager!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.18,0:12:18.55,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Aren't you forgetting an option?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.55,0:12:20.80,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Another option...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.80,0:12:24.48,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,There's nothing like another girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.48,0:12:26.65,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,H-Hayakawa-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.65,0:12:28.03,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.03,0:12:30.06,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Why would you take it that way?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.06,0:12:33.02,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,You brought it up, Katase-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.02,0:12:36.84,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,but aren't you curious about what's going on \Nwith Shinozaki-kun and Hayakawa-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.40,0:12:41.61,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,N-Not really. The two of them \Ncan be as friendly as they want...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.61,0:12:45.66,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,B-Besides, why would I care?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.66,0:12:47.68,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,I dunno, why would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.68,0:12:50.91,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Aw! Don't answer a question \Nwith another question!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.20,0:12:54.99,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Come on, we better hurry before \Nthe lunch crowds fill everywhere up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.99,0:12:56.27,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,But why would you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.27,0:12:57.42,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Manager!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.93,0:13:02.20,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,The manager found out you're an otaku?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.20,0:13:03.51,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,I got careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.89,0:13:05.18,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,How'd that even happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.73,0:13:07.58,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Did he see something you were drawing...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.58,0:13:10.43,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.09,0:13:15.19,Italics,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Shinozaki knows I'm an otaku, \Nbut not about the cosplay stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.56,0:13:19.31,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I don't really think him knowing \Nis a problem, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.04,0:13:23.57,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Well... maybe not a big problem...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.50,0:13:26.25,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Not a serious one, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.57,0:13:29.57,Flashback,Akina,0,0,0,,Cute... Cute... Cute...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.74,0:13:33.87,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,If it's not a problem, then what's the issue?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.87,0:13:34.83,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.57,0:13:38.70,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,I guess I should be glad \Nhe didn't see me drawing BL dojinshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.70,0:13:40.17,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Whacha talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.17,0:13:41.46,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,M-Manager?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.05,0:13:44.46,Italics,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Did he hear all that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.19,0:13:47.34,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Are you here for lunch with Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.34,0:13:49.21,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Are you curious?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.21,0:13:53.60,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Not exactly... and why are you \Ngrinning like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.60,0:13:56.73,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Do you mind if \Nwe join you for lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.73,0:13:58.48,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Oh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.48,0:14:02.48,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,In that case, I wanna sit \Nnext to Hayakawa-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.10,0:14:05.23,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Don't let it bug you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.23,0:14:07.49,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,What is up with you today?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.80,0:14:10.08,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I wonder what I should get.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.08,0:14:11.69,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,I'm curious, Hayakawa-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.40,0:14:14.97,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,What's BL?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.96,0:14:19.56,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,W-Well, it's, er... it is sort of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.19,0:14:24.07,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Hayakawa-san? \NYou've gone bright red.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.22,0:14:27.01,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,I-I-I wonder why.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.68,0:14:30.78,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Is it okay if I make this picture \Nmy home screen background?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.78,0:14:32.07,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.16,0:14:37.40,Main,Shiori/Eyecatch,0,0,0,,{\i1}My Tiny Senpai{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.71,0:14:42.38,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Shinozaki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.23,0:14:50.24,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Trick or treat! \NHappy Halloween, Shinozaki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.64,0:14:51.98,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.24,0:14:55.79,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,It's Halloween, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.79,0:14:56.67,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.68,0:14:59.92,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,It's cu—er, very nice looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.92,0:15:01.82,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I was kinda surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.82,0:15:05.75,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,That being the case, \Nonce again: trick or treat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.64,0:15:10.26,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,S-Sorry, I didn't get anything ready...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.35,0:15:12.83,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.83,0:15:14.26,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Here you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.04,0:15:16.41,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Oh, thank yo—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.39,0:15:30.03,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,T-Trick or treat?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.03,0:15:32.53,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Well done! Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.93,0:15:34.70,Main - Top,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Come on, don't treat me like a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.36,0:15:37.45,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,What are you grinning about? \NAnd with cat ears on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.70,0:15:36.60,Main - Top,Shiori,0,0,0,,Which one would you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.41,0:15:42.04,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Just thinking how this is going to be \None sugary Halloween!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.80,0:15:44.73,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,By the way, Hayakawa-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.42,0:15:48.00,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Happy Halloween!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.42,0:15:52.26,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Yep, I was right. Your cat-like \Nnature makes it a good fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.68,0:15:54.17,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,And we match!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.17,0:15:57.26,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,M-Manager! Wearing cat ears at work is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.43,0:16:00.27,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(325,340)\fnComic Sans MS\b1\fsp2\c&H000000&\bord0\shad0}*Can't bring herself to take them off
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.16,0:16:05.77,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,The trick to happiness is a bowl of candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.77,0:16:07.85,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I love Halloween!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.85,0:16:09.53,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,It's pretty great.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.26,0:16:13.13,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,It's not a good idea to \Noverindulge on sweets, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.13,0:16:15.78,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Right! It can cause all kinds of problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.78,0:16:19.15,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,But it's Halloween, so what can you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.15,0:16:20.81,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.81,0:16:25.28,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,That also applies to Christmas, Valentine's, \Nbirthdays, and Hinamatsuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.28,0:16:26.68,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Agreed!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.68,0:16:28.42,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,That's a lot of exceptions!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.06,0:16:30.92,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Senpai, did you try these chocolates?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.76,0:16:33.87,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.87,0:16:36.18,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,They're pretty good. \NThey've got a more mature taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.46,0:16:39.18,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,A mature taste?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.04,0:16:46.01,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I-Is she...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.30,0:16:50.90,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Sh-She's waiting for me to \Nfeed her the chocolate?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.20,0:16:53.16,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,But if I do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.65,0:17:00.16,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,M-My finger might touch Senpai's mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.16,0:17:06.04,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,But a chance like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.97,0:17:12.84,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Yoink.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.84,0:17:17.08,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Too bad. Time's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.20,0:17:22.30,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.52,0:17:27.50,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I'm so stupid! I wasted my chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.50,0:17:29.08,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Shinozaki-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.35,0:17:35.86,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I-I feel weirdly toasty now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.55,0:17:40.24,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Shinozaki, is there any candy left?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.24,0:17:43.24,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Hayakawa-shan! Hayakawa-shan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.50,0:17:49.23,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Smooch! Smooch! Smooch!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.92,0:17:49.66,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,What's going on with Katase-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.23,0:17:50.86,Main - Top,Shiori,0,0,0,,Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.66,0:17:52.55,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,She just had one of these chocolates...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.55,0:17:53.51,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Chocolate?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.89,0:17:56.01,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Oh, these have alcohol in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.28,0:17:59.42,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Who could get that drunk off \Nof one chocolate?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.01,0:18:01.67,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Smooooch!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.01,0:18:02.76,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Would someone please help me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.76,0:18:04.44,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Who would've guessed that \NKatase-san would turn
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.44,0:18:06.12,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,into a kissing machine\Nwhen she gets drunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.12,0:18:07.64,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,A kissing machine...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.64,0:18:10.12,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Does that mean I've got a chance?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.12,0:18:11.78,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Shinozaki-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.52,0:18:16.03,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Uh, well, I—I wasn't thinking \Nanything naughty!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.03,0:18:17.28,Italics,Akina,0,0,0,,Stare...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.28,0:18:19.28,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Could you at least say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.03,0:18:23.03,Main - Top,Akina,0,0,0,,Sorry, sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.03,0:18:23.03,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.03,0:18:24.99,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Manager! Manager!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.46,0:18:27.61,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Manager...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.61,0:18:29.42,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,To be honest, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.42,0:18:32.90,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,There's something I need to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.34,0:18:37.44,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Senpai! Senpai! Our manager \Ndoesn't photosynthesize.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.44,0:18:38.84,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Over there, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.93,0:18:41.88,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,I'm right over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.88,0:18:42.93,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.93,0:18:44.93,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Manager! Manager!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.26,0:18:51.37,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Manager... the truth is, there's \Nsomething I need to tell you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.92,0:18:53.82,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Wait, is this going where I think it is?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.11,0:18:56.61,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Are Senpai... and Manager going to...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.61,0:18:58.82,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,K-K-K-Kiss?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.97,0:19:03.40,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Manager...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.58,0:19:08.08,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,No! Hold on, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.13,0:19:16.04,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I am so, so grateful for the way that you \Nalways, always work so hard for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.04,0:19:18.19,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,and to get our work done!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.19,0:19:19.63,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,She's bowing out of gratitude?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.84,0:19:23.37,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Maybe it's less about kissing
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.37,0:19:26.66,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,and more about her emotions \Ntowards people getting amplified?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.14,0:19:29.46,Main - Top,Shiori,0,0,0,,Oh bless you, bless you, God and Manager!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.39,0:19:31.00,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Th-That might be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.00,0:19:33.90,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I'm partly glad, and partly disappointed...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.90,0:19:37.96,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Now, then, Katase-senpai, \Nyour kohai's right over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.68,0:19:39.90,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,My kohai?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.49,0:19:42.91,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Kohai, Kohai!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.91,0:19:46.41,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Hang on! Finding out \Nhow she feels about me...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.41,0:19:48.68,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I-I'm not emotionally prepared for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.41,0:19:52.67,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,U-Uh, Senpai, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.55,0:20:00.80,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Wha...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.92,0:20:04.30,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Tears?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.30,0:20:08.33,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I-I'm so sorry! I know I'm always \Ncausing trouble for you, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.33,0:20:09.56,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,It's not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.03,0:20:13.28,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,You used to have no idea \Nwhat to do on your own,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.28,0:20:16.28,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,but you're so capable now...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.28,0:20:19.07,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,It makes me really happy, as your senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.07,0:20:20.82,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,So she's my mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.82,0:20:22.07,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.55,0:20:27.33,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,if you do need help, \Nyou can always turn to me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.68,0:20:29.75,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,S-Senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.33,0:20:34.51,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I-I think I'm gonna get you some water! \NYou sit here and wait a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.89,0:20:33.06,Main - Top,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.51,0:20:36.08,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,'Kay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.40,0:20:36.08,Main - Top,Akina,0,0,0,,Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.84,0:20:41.21,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,So Senpai thinks...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.55,0:20:44.72,Flashback,Shiori,0,0,0,,You used to have no idea \Nwhat to do on your own...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.52,0:20:49.47,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I'm a little disappointed, \Nbut I'm still glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.17,0:20:52.86,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Katase-san, Katase-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.31,0:20:58.98,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,What do you think about Shinozaki-kun \Npersonally, and not as a coworker?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.99,0:21:04.06,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Senpai, I've got your water.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.06,0:21:05.74,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Shinozaki-san is...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.40,0:21:13.20,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,When it comes to him... I'm not sure yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.62,0:21:18.57,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,I thought I had her that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.57,0:21:21.50,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Never mind that! Could you \Nplease delete that picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.20,0:21:23.42,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Which one do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.42,0:21:25.96,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,The one with Katase-san and I... y'know...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.96,0:21:26.87,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,This one?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.28,0:21:29.28,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Hurry up and delete it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.28,0:21:30.75,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Can I use it on my home screen?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.75,0:21:32.47,Main,Hayakwa,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.26,0:21:50.14,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,Bleary-eyed and not fully awake from a dream
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.14,0:21:55.04,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,I still can't bring myself \Nto drink that bitter coffee
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.60,0:21:59.52,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,So I sneakily toss in \Ntwo pinches of a sweet secret
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.52,0:22:03.74,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,And let it slowly spread throughout
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.96,0:22:08.70,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,There's a local bakery \Nthat's only open sometimes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.70,0:22:13.59,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,Where I once had some toast that glittered
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.25,0:22:18.09,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,What is it that makes it so satisfying?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.09,0:22:22.26,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,Almost like magic
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.68,0:22:27.34,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,I find myself thinking about that kind of thing
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.34,0:22:33.03,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,How the small things can be the most precious
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.79,0:22:37.74,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,Deep inside my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.74,0:22:42.14,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,It's ever so bittersweet
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.01,0:22:47.13,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,"Just being around you is enough"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.13,0:22:51.08,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,Becomes my mantra
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.08,0:22:53.37,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,Baby like sugar
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.56,0:23:02.70,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,Baby you're the sugar
